# Material that must not ship with a Git-based Vercel deployment.
# The runtime needs: package.json, package-lock.json, vercel.json, src/, public/,
# database/ and scripts/ (see scripts/check.mjs and DEPLOY-FIRST.md).
# Note: docs/ and DEPLOY-FIRST.md are intentionally NOT ignored here, to stay
# consistent with scripts/package-vercel.mjs, which ships them in the release ZIP.
tests/
preview-db/
private-data/
test-results/
playwright-report/
*.log
.env.*
google_drive/
.venv/
